OL,3,GNEWSACandle warning after home
OL,4,Adevastated by fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire officials have issued safety
OL,7,Fadvice after a candle left burning near
OL,8,Fa towel caused a house fire that badly
OL,9,Fdamaged a home in Leicestershire.
OL,11,FThe blaze started in a bedroom at a
OL,12,Fproperty in Church Street, Lutterworth,
OL,13,Fat about 05:20 GMT on Monday.
OL,15,FAbout 80% of the second floor was
OL,16,Fdamaged while smoke affected other
OL,17,Fparts of the property. All people in
OL,18,Fthe house were accounted for and nobody
OL,19,Fwas injured.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
